# Build context for the API image is the repo root. Host build output must never be copied in:
# obj/ holds Windows-specific NuGet asset paths that break `dotnet publish` inside the container.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
.git/
.claude/
docs/
tests/
web/
docker-compose.yml
# Deploy scripts and infra/azure.env (deployment secrets) -- `az acr build` uploads this context.
infra/
**/*.log
